The Addams Family is a comedy, fantasy film directed by Barry Sonnenfeld.

3
00:13:38,181 --> 00:13:44,181
When a man claiming to be long-lost Uncle Fester reappears after 25 years
lost, the family plans a celebration to wake the dead.

4
